  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#the-canvas-element\r\n\r\n```\r\nRenderingContext? getContext(DOMString contextId, any... arguments);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `getContext()` signature is defined to be variadic but it seems specs only use dictionary form argument.\r\n\r\n>`context = canvas . getContext('2d' [, { [ alpha: false ] } ] )`\r\n>`context = canvas . getContext('bitmaprenderer' [, { [ alpha: false ] } ] )`\r\n\r\nhttps://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/#5.2\r\n\r\n>```\r\n>var context = canvas.getContext('webgl',\r\n>                                { antialias: false,\r\n>                                  stencil: true });\r\n>```\r\n\r\nShould the variadic signature be kept when dictionary formed argument is preferred?",
